    "market_commentary": "The SSY Pacific Capesize Index climbed 552 points week-on-week to 4,998, still less than half the year-ago level. The W.Australia-China iron ore spot voyage rate rose $1.30 to $8.90/t, while the round-voyage rate increased by $6,500/day to $10,500/day.",
